     iinnssttaallllbboooott — install bootstrap on a disk

SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
     iinnssttaallllbboooott [--ccnnvv] [--rr _r_o_o_t] _d_i_s_k [_s_t_a_g_e_1 [_s_t_a_g_e_2]]
